<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Bula 1996 pre-tax loss 10.7 mln punts.</title>
<headline>Bula 1996 pre-tax loss 10.7 mln punts.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish-based exploration group Bula Resources said its pre-tax losses increased to 10.7 million Irish pounds in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said in results for the year ended December 31, 1996 that it had been a difficult year for the group's Russian interests due to disappointing drilling results from its programme in the Salmskoye oil field.</p>
</text>
